{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/triton-lang/triton/issues/6547","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:57:13.309126+00:00","comments":[],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"NONE","body":"### Describe the bug\n\nUsing triton.autotune with the kernel updated in place will result in incorrect output。\nIn the following code, the kernel updates logits_ptr in place to avoid allocating extra memory. When using triton.autotune, the kernel is executed multiple times, which can cause logits_ptr to become incorrect. Adding the reset_to_zero parameter will set logits_ptr to 0, resulting in an error.\n\n\n``` python\n@triton.autotune(\n    configs=[\n        triton.Config({'BLOCK_SIZE': 16}, num_warps=4),\n        triton.Config({'BLOCK_SIZE': 32}, num_warps=8),\n    ],\n    key=['rows', 'cols'], \n    reset_to_zero=['logits_ptr'],\n    restore_value=['logits_ptr']\n)\n\n@triton.jit\ndef inplace_scale_2d_kernel(\n    logits_ptr,\n    logits_row_stride,  \n    scaling_penalties_ptr,\n    penalties_row_stride,\n    rows, cols,          \n    BLOCK_SIZE: tl.constexpr,\n):\n    pid_row = tl.program_id(0)\n    pid_col = tl.program_id(1)\n    \n    row_offsets = pid_row * BLOCK_SIZE + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_SIZE)\n    col_offsets = pid_col * BLOCK_SIZE + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_SIZE)\n    row_mask = row_offsets[:, None] < rows  # [BLOCK_SIZE, 1]\n    col_mask = col_offsets[None, :] < cols  # [1, BLOCK_SIZE]\n    mask = row_mask & col_mask              # [BLOCK_SIZE, BLOCK_SIZE]\n    \n    logits_offsets = row_offsets[:, None] * logits_row_stride + col_offsets[None, :]\n    logits = tl.load(logits_ptr + logits_offsets, mask=mask)\n\n    penalties_offsets = row_offsets[:, None] * penalties_row_stride + col_offsets[None, :],\n    penalties = tl.load(scaling_penalties_ptr + penalties_offsets, mask=mask)\n\n    condition = logits > 0\n    scaled = logits / tl.where(condition, penalties, 1.0/penalties)\n    tl.store(logits_ptr + logits_offsets, scaled, mask=mask)\n```\n\n### Environment details\n\ntriton                            3.1.0\nA800GPU","closed_at":"2025-04-24T07:48:02Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11783027?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zwc163/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zwc163/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zwc163/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zwc163/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zwc163","id":11783027,"login":"zwc163","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzgzMDI3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zwc163/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zwc163/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zwc163/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zwc163/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zwc163/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zwc163","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":0,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/triton-lang/triton/issues/6547/comments","created_at":"2025-04-21T12:42:47Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/triton-lang/triton/issues/6547/events","html_url":"https://github.com/triton-lang/triton/issues/6547","id":3008339711,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"fc2929","default":true,"description":null,"id":125679820,"name":"bug","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMjU2Nzk4MjA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/triton-lang/triton/labels/bug"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/triton-lang/triton/issues/6547/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"I_kwDOAWaHXs6zT57_","number":6547,"performed_via_github_app":null,"pinned_comment":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,